Zoran: Ah, patience... 
Zoran: A virtue so many lack...
<<Act Zoran zoranTalk 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Fortunately, I excel at it.
<<Act Zoran zoranChill 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: I trust some may rub off on you if you listen to me Your Majesty?

<<LookAt 2 7>>
<<Act Zoran zoranChill 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: That number slowly ticking up? <br>That’s the unit count.
<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: The crafty work of the local War Commissar's recrutment campaign, ha-ha.

<<LookAt 0 7>>
<<Act Zoran zoranTalk 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Of course, your enemies aren’t just sitting around picking their noses...
<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Their towns are regenerating too. So… perhaps waiting too long to bolster your troops isn’t ideal, either.

<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Timing, your majesty, is everything. 
<<Act Zoran zoranTalk 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: A decisive ruler knows when to strike.
<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>> 
